2	//! Domain-layer types that represent **models**, **strategies**, and **versioned
3	//! artefacts** used by ProfitPulse AI.
4	//!
5	//! This module purposely contains **no I/O or side-effects**—that is delegated
6	//! to the _ports & adapters_ layer.  Here we only describe behaviour that is
7	//! meaningful for the business (forecasting) domain.
